OL,3,GNEWSASoldiers report rats, ants and
OL,4,Amould at training camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoldiers in an Army training camp have
OL,7,Freported living in housing infested
OL,8,Fwith rats, ants and mould, the Local
OL,9,FDemocracy Reporting Service (LDRS) has
OL,10,Frevealed.
OL,12,FThe Army Training Centre Pirbright,
OL,13,Fnear Guildford, helps deliver basic
OL,14,Ftraining to recruits joining army
OL,15,Fregiments including the Royal Artillery
OL,16,Fand the Royal Engineers.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
