OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASoldiers report rats, ants and
OL,4,Amould at training camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports obtained by the LDRS through
OL,7,Ffreedom of information laws have
OL,8,Falleged some soldiers are living in
OL,9,F"unacceptable" conditions, with 16
OL,10,Fpest-related complaints filed in 2026
OL,11,Falone.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) said:
OL,14,F"After years of underfunding, this
OL,15,Fgovernment is undertaking the biggest
OL,16,Fupgrade to service family accommodation
OL,17,Fin more than 50 years."
